---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This license covers the source code (Geografia_do_voto.ipynb) and the map
rendering (index.html). The underlying data remain under the terms of their
original providers and must be credited as such:

- Tribunal Superior Eleitoral (TSE), Portal de Dados Abertos - Creative
  Commons Attribution (CC BY): voting locations, voters per section and
  ballot box reports (Boletim de Urna).
- Instituto Brasileiro de Geografia e Estatistica (IBGE): territorial
  meshes (2022 Census neighborhoods, municipalities, states).
- OpenStreetMap contributors - Open Database License (ODbL 1.0): geocoding
  (Nominatim) and overseas municipal boundaries.
- Basemaps: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, (c) CARTO; Esri.
